{"reviews":[{"id":"B000GCVVWI-0","r":2.0,"t":"Thick Like Tar on my 4C Hair","x":"I used this product 5-6 times total in a 3 week spand, using before I straightened my hair with a low heat temperature curling iron (temperature settings were 1-25. I used temperture setting #'s 11 & 13) for my hair in which I had to go over 2-3 times and my hair was still thick as hell being 75% un-straightened and 80% stretched if that makes any sense. This product had too much protein in it for my hair which made my sponge like hair dry like a brillo pad. Now, the first time that I used Palme","h":30,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great Stuff","x":"This has worked very well on my edges. I use a classic hot-comb to get my 4C natural edges to lay very flat, this, along with a heat protectant and it last a while, no gel needed!","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-2","r":4.0,"t":"Pleased","x":"I have used this product many times before. I really like it.  I am just happy to be able to buy it conveniently online.  The product is just as great as always.  Nongreasy!","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2011"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-3","r":5.0,"t":"I'm Empressed  & Perfectly Pressed","x":"Great product. As a professional hair stylist, in the past I used Dudley's hair pressing wax, which doesn't seem to be around anymore. Didn't think I would ever find a product as good, but this one meets my criteria. For the African American women doing that natural hair thing, if you press your hair, this is the product you want to use.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-4","r":5.0,"t":"pressing oil","x":"was an excellent product for pressing hair. it work well and you didn't have to use very much while using the hot comb.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2012"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-5","r":5.0,"t":"Love this Stuff","x":"This product is wonderful for African American or coarse hair; especially when straightening.  It leaves the hair shiny but not greasy! I received this product before the scheduled arrival date.  I'm a Cosmetologists and my clients love this product!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2013"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-6","r":4.0,"t":"Good","x":"I like the smell and its very light. Package came on time. I did not have any problems. Would recommend.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2012"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great hair","x":"Worked really realy great have had the one container for more than a year and still going strong!!!! Would recommend this product to anyone!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2013"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-8","r":4.0,"t":"which is fantastic!","x":"This makes my hair so soft and makes it feel as if it has been deeply conditioned. I add an equal drop of pomegranate oil and rosemary oil. This pressing oil is very light, which is fantastic!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-9","r":5.0,"t":"so glad I found this again had to look too hard for it.","x":"Perfect don't go changing anything about this product.It's perfect as it is !!!so glad I found this again had to look too hard for it.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-10","r":4.0,"t":"works good","x":"I only used it a few times so far, but works fairly well.  I will use it again in the future.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2012"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-11","r":5.0,"t":"If you want to give your hair a rest from flat irons try this!","x":"This protein packed pressing oil is perfect for an &#34;old school&#34; warm press. This clearly is a great product, I experienced no breakage damage with using this sparingly on the ends and roots of my color bleached hair. I wanted to give my shoulder length hair a rest from flat irons every two days. I can use this product sparingly with a warm pressing comb once a week and the hair stays straight and does not revert with humidity and rain. Love this stuff it is gold in a jar.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-12","r":5.0,"t":"no store for me","x":"I liked fact I did not have to leave my house or go to the store. Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea! Yea!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2013"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-13","r":5.0,"t":"Palmers Hair Pressing Oil","x":"Very Good, made the hair feel good and was very shiny, worked well with the Hot Comb, do recommend it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-14","r":4.0,"t":"Very light oil for black hair.","x":"It's a very light oil hair, so it does't bog down pressed hair. I definitely plan to keep using it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2013"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-15","r":4.0,"t":"GOOD BUY AND NICE PRICE.","x":"LIKE THE SMELL BUT USE A LITTLE. IT GOES A LONG WAY!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-16","r":5.0,"t":"I would differently recommend this product for anyone who is going the natural ...","x":"Made my hair soft and shine after I used before putting my pressing comb on my hair... I would differently recommend this product for anyone who is going the natural route.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-17","r":5.0,"t":"pressing oil","x":"this is the best oil that I have use for my hair if growths the hair and shine the hair press the hair so good went you pressing it, I love to use this pressing oil.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2013"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-18","r":5.0,"t":"... and who knew it had protein in it a great addition so it's great for the growth of your ...","x":"This pressing grease really does keep your hair straight longer and who knew it had protein in it a great addition so it's great for the growth of your hair as well.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-19","r":3.0,"t":"A little to heavy","x":"A little to heavy for me. I have to learn the right amount to use or it weighs my hair down. But I like the smell and I can use it if I don't put too much on","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2013"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-20","r":5.0,"t":"Palmers Hair Care Pressing Oil","x":"I love the product it is perfect for my hair gives it a smooth very straight look, feel and shine.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2013"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-21","r":2.0,"t":"Two Stars","x":"Smallest amount is need otherwise it makes my hair very greasy.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-22","r":4.0,"t":"Good!","x":"Pretty good prodcut if you want to press natural hair","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-23","r":5.0,"t":"I like this product very much It is light","x":"I like this product very much  It is light, not heavy on the hair but holds heat for the hot comb. It does have a light sent, some may find intrusive, I however did not.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B000GCVVWI-24","r":5.0,"t":"i love this","x":"it doesnt build up on the hair,it prevents burning the hair.i have used other products years ago know palmers for quality.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2014"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers widely praise the product for working well with a hot comb or warm press, especially on coarse or natural hair.","cites":[2,4,5,6,12,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers describe the oil as light and non-greasy, leaving hair shiny without weighing it down.","cites":[3,6,7,9,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say they would recommend it or plan to keep using it, with some noting a single container lasts a long time.","cites":[7,8,11,14,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers appreciate the convenience of buying it online rather than in a store.","cites":[3,13]},{"text":"One reviewer found it too thick and ineffective for straightening their 4C hair.","cites":[1]}]},"qa":[]}